[Mission.Objectives]
Liberate Vysochany from the German occupants and destroy enemy foothold.
[Mission.Description]
You must eliminate the enemy garrison in Kurtenki that controls the road to Vysochany; secure this road; destroy enemy armoured troops in the Kurtenki-Vysochany area; and suppress artillery on the southern outskirts of Vysochany.
[Mission.Success]
Task accomplished, Vysochany liberated.
[Mission.Failed]
Task failed.
[Submission1.Objectives]
Liberate Kurtenki.
[Submission1.Description]
Eliminate enemy garrison in Kurtenki and secure the road to Vysochany. Get ready to repel enemy counter-attack.
[Submission1.Success]
Kurtenki secured.
[Submission1.Failed]
Task failed.
[Submission2.Objectives]
Destroy enemy armoured column coming to the aid of Kurtenki’s garrison.
[Submission2.Description]
The enemy armoured column is coming to the aid of Kurtenki’s garrison from Vysochany. Intercept and destroy it by drawing it into an ambush.
[Submission2.Success]
Enemy column destroyed.
[Submission2.Failed]
Task failed.
[Submission3.Objectives]
Another enemy armoured group set off from Vysochany to intercept you. Destroy it and proceed to liberation of the village.
[Submission3.Description]
Fully secure the road to Vysochany. Destroy enemy armoured group.
[Submission3.Success]
The road to Vysochany is free.
[Submission3.Failed]
Task accomplished.